% Create banking ARFF data (Balance, Age, Transactions, RiskLevel); apply J48 with 10-fold CV.

@relation bank_risk

@attribute Balance numeric
@attribute Age numeric
@attribute Transactions numeric
@attribute RiskLevel {Low,Medium,High}

@data
50000,45,120,Low
15000,25,30,High
30000,35,70,Medium
75000,55,200,Low
8000,22,15,High
42000,40,100,Medium
90000,60,250,Low
20000,30,45,High
